Stand... You, too.

282
00:09:03,660 --> 00:09:05,020
- Oh, I have to stand, too?
- Stand up.

283
00:09:05,100 --> 00:09:06,160
Point your toe.

284
00:09:06,180 --> 00:09:07,220
Both of you.

285
00:09:07,250 --> 00:09:08,250
