293
00:09:18,130 --> 00:09:19,340
- Hey, wait!
- Hey, wait, wait, wait.

294
00:09:19,360 --> 00:09:20,460
You have to be here with me.

295
00:09:20,750 --> 00:09:22,150
That way, I'll know...

296
00:09:22,160 --> 00:09:23,510
