312
00:09:51,630 --> 00:09:52,360
Take care of Dax for me.

313
00:09:52,490 --> 00:09:53,110
What?

314
00:09:53,350 --> 00:09:53,990
Bye-bye.

315
00:09:54,010 --> 00:09:55,130
Oh, please...

316
00:09:55,140 --> 00:09:55,980
Leave him.

317
00:09:56,050 --> 00:09:57,780
You still have time,
so come help me with my student.

318
00:09:57,810 --> 00:09:59,090
- Here. Come.
- Come here, quick.

319
00:09:59,110 --> 00:09:59,960
Come here.

320
00:10:00,010 --> 00:10:01,260
Come, come, come.

321
00:10:01,280 --> 00:10:01,900
Come here.

322
00:10:01,920 --> 00:10:02,860
Don't just stand there.

323
