331
00:10:14,890 --> 00:10:18,080
- ♫Wa, wa, wa, wa, wa, wa, wa, wa, wa♫
- ♫Wa, wa, wa, wa, wa, wa, wa, wa, wa♫

332
00:10:18,100 --> 00:10:19,590
You two, don't just stand there.

333
00:10:19,610 --> 00:10:21,040
All together now.

334
00:10:21,060 --> 00:10:24,660
- ♫Wa, wa, wa, wa, wa, wa, wa, wa, wa♫
- ♫Wa, wa, wa, wa, wa, wa, wa, wa, wa♫

335
00:10:24,680 --> 00:10:25,980
Good!

336
00:10:26,330 --> 00:10:27,430
