338
00:10:28,690 --> 00:10:30,230
That's all, Mr. Drip.

339
00:10:31,800 --> 00:10:32,700
Here you go.

340
00:10:32,720 --> 00:10:34,390
Thank you so much, Mr. Drip.

341
00:10:34,690 --> 00:10:36,470
I officially welcome you

342
00:10:36,500 --> 00:10:39,630
