343
00:10:39,650 --> 00:10:41,150
Thank you for helping me.

344
00:10:41,170 --> 00:10:43,950
I'll pay for your meal, then.

345
00:10:44,590 --> 00:10:47,150
You're welcome.
Don't mind if I do, then.

346
00:10:48,180 --> 00:10:49,340
Auntie Duang!

347
00:10:49,360 --> 00:10:50,120
Yes?

348
00:10:50,140 --> 00:10:51,070
Check, please?

349
00:10:51,990 --> 00:10:53,160
One hundred and twenty baht.

350
00:10:53,510 --> 00:10:54,510
Cool!

351
00:10:55,710 --> 00:10:57,500
Are you dressing up as a milestone?

352
00:10:58,390 --> 00:10:59,350
Whoa, that mouth...

353
00:10:59,950 --> 00:11:01,860
Asking me to burn your room down, huh?

354
00:11:02,470 --> 00:11:03,470
Burn his room down?

355
