If you do that,
the fire's gonna reach your room.

356
00:11:05,970 --> 00:11:07,900
Because your rooms
are right next to each other.

357
00:11:08,110 --> 00:11:08,980
Hey!

358
00:11:09,050 --> 00:11:10,430
Our stores are close,

359
00:11:10,590 --> 00:11:11,660
