360
00:11:11,730 --> 00:11:12,280
Hey,

361
00:11:12,560 --> 00:11:14,230
when are you gonna stop pestering me, hm?

362
00:11:17,380 --> 00:11:18,150
One hundred and twenty baht.

363
00:11:18,170 --> 00:11:18,810
Yes, Auntie.

364
00:11:21,170 --> 00:11:22,260
Danis!

365
00:11:22,400 --> 00:11:24,070
You'll have to find a new handyman for this dorm.

366
00:11:24,520 --> 00:11:25,110
