376
00:11:41,570 --> 00:11:42,360
Oh!

377
00:11:42,390 --> 00:11:43,550
You're the scammer!

378
00:11:43,570 --> 00:11:45,090
You burned me with hot water,

379
00:11:45,110 --> 00:11:46,430
