385
00:11:53,240 --> 00:11:57,270
♫There has to be a day, some day♫

386
00:11:57,410 --> 00:11:59,670
♫Two days, three days♫

387
00:11:59,760 --> 00:12:01,690
♫Four days, five days♫

388
00:12:01,810 --> 00:12:04,270
♫Six days, seven days♫

389
00:12:04,290 --> 00:12:05,700
Greetings to my fans.

390
00:12:05,780 --> 00:12:07,270
- This way!
- This way!

391
00:12:07,640 --> 00:12:09,200
There's a reason I'm singing.

392
00:12:09,520 --> 00:12:11,630
I was trying to cheer you up, Ms. Danis.

393
00:12:11,810 --> 00:12:12,290
Oh?

394
00:12:12,400 --> 00:12:13,470
You're tired, aren't you?

395
00:12:13,490 --> 00:12:14,240
Yes.

396
00:12:14,260 --> 00:12:15,200
I'm tired as well!

397
00:12:15,220 --> 00:12:16,310
Just by walking outside,

398
00:12:16,320 --> 00:12:17,040
