399
00:12:17,070 --> 00:12:18,090
♫Thrust a little, black vest♫

400
00:12:18,100 --> 00:12:19,160
♫Thrust, thrust, black vest♫

401
00:12:19,480 --> 00:12:21,560
I was thrusting nonstop, so I'm tired.

402
00:12:21,780 --> 00:12:23,450
And now I have to see
the two of them fighting.

403
00:12:23,470 --> 00:12:24,390
Today is the day

404
00:12:24,700 --> 00:12:26,190
