412
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:41,380
We're in the same dorm.

413
00:12:41,390 --> 00:12:42,400
Why don't we love each other?

414
00:12:42,420 --> 00:12:43,850
I don't love you.

415
00:12:45,550 --> 00:12:47,910
I'll ask you two one last time.

416
00:12:48,720 --> 00:12:50,560
Will you change your mind?!

417
00:12:50,580 --> 00:12:51,660
- No!
- No!

418
00:12:54,230 --> 00:12:55,980
Then it can't be helped.

419
00:13:00,830 --> 00:13:01,720
