420
00:13:01,750 --> 00:13:02,570
- Ow!
- Ow!

421
00:13:02,590 --> 00:13:03,900
- Let go!
- Ow!

422
00:13:03,930 --> 00:13:04,780
Stop. Stop right there.

423
00:13:05,050 --> 00:13:05,620
Guard Dum!

424
00:13:05,640 --> 00:13:07,290
I can report you to the police

425
00:13:07,310 --> 00:13:08,680
