434
00:13:20,480 --> 00:13:21,190
- Never!
- Never!

435
00:13:21,830 --> 00:13:23,200
Good! Stay there, then.

436
00:13:23,220 --> 00:13:25,530
It's like I have two poodles
welcoming my customers.

437
00:13:27,640 --> 00:13:29,410
I tease you because I love you.

438
00:13:29,630 --> 00:13:30,410
Whoa...

439
00:13:30,420 --> 00:13:32,310
You shouldn't stand too close, then.

440
00:13:32,710 --> 00:13:34,740
Or the poodles will pee on the milestone.

441
00:13:34,770 --> 00:13:35,840
I tease you because I love you.

442
00:13:35,850 --> 00:13:37,380
Oh...I got a taste of my own medicine.

443
00:13:38,070 --> 00:13:39,350
I'll have to ask you

444
00:13:39,370 --> 00:13:40,580
