463
00:14:06,040 --> 00:14:06,660
It's you!

464
00:14:06,670 --> 00:14:07,790
- Take this!
- Don't touch me!

465
00:14:07,820 --> 00:14:09,410
- Ugh!
- Oh...

466
00:14:09,520 --> 00:14:10,830
