470
00:14:15,570 --> 00:14:17,040
Oh, you're gorgeous, dear.

471
00:14:17,060 --> 00:14:18,560
- Oh, I'm excited.
- So cute.

472
00:14:18,580 --> 00:14:20,240
You're stunning!

473
