try to eat more food for your brain, Dollar.

489
00:14:51,290 --> 00:14:51,930
Oh, how dare you!

490
00:14:51,950 --> 00:14:54,630
- That's right. Get omega three, six, nine, eleven
- Hey...

491
00:14:54,650 --> 00:14:56,080
