517
00:15:36,930 --> 00:15:38,420
- Okay.
- Good.

518
00:15:39,840 --> 00:15:40,350
Come here.

519
00:15:40,690 --> 00:15:41,630
Excuse me.

520
00:15:42,280 --> 00:15:43,600
