- Is this a good idea?

521
00:15:43,620 --> 00:15:44,550
- Come here
- Is this a good idea?

522
00:15:44,570 --> 00:15:45,850
- Sit, sit, sit.
- Um, I've never...

523
00:15:45,870 --> 00:15:47,410
Sit down. Give it a try.

524
00:15:47,890 --> 00:15:48,890
Let me see.

525
00:15:53,110 --> 00:15:54,110
