00:16:49,300 --> 00:16:50,230
Oh, wow.

548
00:16:50,250 --> 00:16:50,950
Hey, Grandpa.

549
00:16:50,970 --> 00:16:52,960
Seriously, if I burn these,
will you receive them?

550
00:16:52,980 --> 00:16:53,940
Probably.

551
00:16:54,340 --> 00:16:55,070
Want a pair of glasses?

552
00:16:55,950 --> 00:16:56,360
Here.

553
00:16:59,290 --> 00:17:00,830
It didn't work, Grandpa.

554
00:17:00,850 --> 00:17:03,080
Put in more effort!

555
00:17:03,100 --> 00:17:04,960
You cannot do it half-heartedly.

556
00:17:05,030 --> 00:17:07,950
Focus on sending it to me.

557
00:17:08,109 --> 00:17:08,960
It is that simple.

558
00:17:08,980 --> 00:17:10,740
But I do not want those things anymore.

559
00:17:10,760 --> 00:17:12,829
I just want the mobile phone.

560
00:17:12,859 --> 00:17:14,109
- The phone?
- Yeah.

561
00:17:14,130 --> 00:17:14,730
What for?

562
00:17:14,750 --> 00:17:16,550
Maybe I will use it to watch
vertical dramas!

563
00:17:16,569 --> 00:17:17,630
Oh, sarcastic, huh?

564
00:17:17,650 --> 00:17:20,599
I just want to call my friends who passed.

565
00:17:20,619 --> 00:17:22,660
I am tired of talking to you all the time.

566
00:17:22,680 --> 00:17:23,920
Oh, wow. Okay.

567
00:17:23,940 --> 00:17:25,810
I'm tired of that, too. Alright.

568
00:17:25,940 --> 00:17:26,980
I'll send it to you.

569
00:17:27,290 --> 00:17:29,040
Buddham aranam
dhammam nasangham talanam.

570
00:17:30,420 --> 00:17:31,210
Huh?

571
00:17:31,230 --> 00:17:32,320
Throwit when yu ar done.

572
00:17:32,350 --> 00:17:33,240
Huh? There's a chant, too?

573
00:17:33,260 --> 00:17:34,640
Throw it when you are done!

574
00:17:36,580 --> 00:17:37,500
- Wait, what?!
- Whoa!

575
00:17:40,160 --> 00:17:41,500
Don't you think the outfits look similar?

576
00:17:41,520 --> 00:17:42,080
Yeah...

577
00:17:42,310 --> 00:17:43,310
- Whoa!
- Whoa!

578
00:17:43,330 --> 00:17:44,470
Hey, what's going on?!

579
00:17:45,490 --> 00:17:46,650
- Oh. Whoa.
- Oh.

580
00:17:47,430 --> 00:17:48,060
Hey.

581
00:17:49,220 --> 00:17:50,000
- Dax.
- Ow.

582
00:17:50,020 --> 00:17:51,070
What happened, Dax?

583
00:17:51,090 --> 00:17:52,360
Well,

584
00:17:52,380 --> 00:17:54,220
- Mama Moniga
- Is it dirty?

585
00:17:54,240 --> 00:17:56,390
wants to quit being a cop
and be a drag queen instead.

586
00:17:56,410 --> 00:17:57,830
But their brother wouldn't have it,

587
00:17:57,930 --> 00:17:59,140
so he came to their room.

588
00:17:59,160 --> 00:18:00,480
Yelling and making a huge fuss.

589
00:18:00,500 --> 00:18:01,270
He nearly brought the room down!

590
00:18:01,290 --> 00:18:02,650
You were a cop.

591
00:18:02,670 --> 00:18:04,550
Why did you quit, Dome?

592
00:18:04,620 --> 00:18:05,700
- Look at these outfits.
- Don't pick them up.

593
00:18:08,260 --> 00:18:10,280
I won't let you do
this kind of nonsense again.

594
00:18:10,300 --> 00:18:11,550
Nonsense?

595
00:18:11,770 --> 00:18:13,210
This is the job I love, Din!

596
00:18:13,420 --> 00:18:14,860
And does the job you love

597
00:18:14,880 --> 00:18:15,920
pay the bills?

598
00:18:16,600 --> 00:18:17,830
You'll end up depending on me

599
00:18:17,850 --> 00:18:19,020
or our parents!

600
00:18:19,310 --> 00:18:20,310
Hey...

601
00:18:21,450 --> 00:18:23,030
Calm down, Din.

602
00:18:23,050 --> 00:18:24,240
This is the path

603
00:18:24,260 --> 00:18:25,580
Dome chose.

604
00:18:25,600 --> 00:18:26,410
Stop talking!

605
00:18:27,070 --> 00:18:28,000
You, too.

606
00:18:28,020 --> 00:18:29,040
Who picked those lashes for you?

607
00:18:31,150 --> 00:18:32,480
Seeing them really pisses me off.

608
00:18:33,640 --> 00:18:34,580
Picture this:

609
00:18:34,870 --> 00:18:36,640
if your brother quit being a cop

610
00:18:36,800 --> 00:18:38,240
to do something like this,

611
00:18:38,270 --> 00:18:39,780
would you be okay with that, Dolly?

612
00:18:44,080 --> 00:18:45,150
I'd love that.

613
00:18:45,690 --> 00:18:47,430
Dollar will get to be pretty.

614
00:18:47,450 --> 00:18:48,500
Dolly!

615
00:18:48,680 --> 00:18:49,660
You stop talking.

616
00:18:49,680 --> 00:18:50,350
Stop right there.

617
00:18:50,520 --> 00:18:51,800
But to be honest,

618
00:18:51,930 --> 00:18:53,560
drag queen performers

619
00:18:53,580 --> 00:18:54,970
make a lot of money.

620
00:18:54,990 --> 00:18:56,430
Especially the top performers,

621
00:18:56,460 --> 00:18:58,180
