is easy?

624
00:19:04,330 --> 00:19:06,580
Not everyone who does this
will end up successful!

625
00:19:06,610 --> 00:19:08,750
I know it's not easy,

626
00:19:09,830 --> 00:19:12,550
but can't I choose to live my life
the way I want?

627
00:19:13,690 --> 00:19:14,790
This is your life,

628
00:19:14,810 --> 00:19:15,890
not a pair of sandals.

629
00:19:15,910 --> 00:19:17,690
You cannot just keep changing things.

630
00:19:17,710 --> 00:19:20,190
Making the wrong choice will ruin your life!

631
00:19:21,800 --> 00:19:22,800
Dome,

632
00:19:23,620 --> 00:19:25,110
