633
00:19:26,750 --> 00:19:28,720
So why are you risking your future...

634
00:19:28,740 --> 00:19:30,010
with something like this?

635
00:19:33,530 --> 00:19:35,000
At least I'm happy.

636
00:19:36,190 --> 00:19:37,480
You're my brother.

637
00:19:38,200 --> 00:19:39,890
Shouldn't you be happy

638
00:19:40,590 --> 00:19:41,750
