639
00:19:47,000 --> 00:19:48,510
This is the last time I'm gonna say this.

640
00:19:50,200 --> 00:19:51,680
If you're still going to quit,

641
00:19:53,000 --> 00:19:53,990
then don't call me your brother anymore.

642
00:19:57,100 --> 00:19:58,100
Din.

643
00:20:00,810 --> 00:20:01,710
Dome...

644
00:20:02,400 --> 00:20:03,480
Fine.

645
00:20:04,010 --> 00:20:05,080
Hey, Dome.

646
00:20:05,100 --> 00:20:05,780
Dome...

647
00:20:08,600 --> 00:20:09,480
Dome!

648
00:20:09,690 --> 00:20:11,090
- Dome, wait!
- Dome!

649
00:20:15,250 --> 00:20:16,380
Whoa,

650
00:20:16,410 --> 00:20:18,490
