651
00:20:18,510 --> 00:20:19,200
Yeah...

652
00:20:19,220 --> 00:20:20,020
if I were him,

653
00:20:20,050 --> 00:20:23,090
I would not just
cut ties with them, I am telling you.

654
00:20:23,110 --> 00:20:24,750
I will wait for them
to get what they deserve!

655
00:20:24,780 --> 00:20:26,860
We are older and wiser.

656
00:20:26,880 --> 00:20:28,750
You should listen to what we say!

657
00:20:29,250 --> 00:20:30,710
- Get what they deserve?
- Mm.

658
00:20:31,000 --> 00:20:32,550
Like what you did to Mom?

659
00:20:35,670 --> 00:20:36,380
Dobby...

660
00:20:36,400 --> 00:20:37,510
Who were you talking to?

661
00:20:37,830 --> 00:20:38,830
Your grandpa?

662
00:20:38,890 --> 00:20:40,430
It is not the same.

663
00:20:40,590 --> 00:20:42,090
Those brothers are fighting,

664
00:20:42,120 --> 00:20:43,290
