Here.

668
00:20:48,470 --> 00:20:49,470
What?!

669
00:20:49,490 --> 00:20:51,180
I ordered pad kra pao, Auntie.

670
00:20:51,600 --> 00:20:52,560
Why did you give me khanom jeen?

671
00:20:52,580 --> 00:20:55,150
Hey, you're just a prisoner.
What right do you have to choose?

672
00:20:55,170 --> 00:20:57,890
I told her to make khanom jeen for you.

673
00:20:57,910 --> 00:20:58,910
Here.

674
00:20:59,490 --> 00:21:00,860
Your spoon.

675
00:21:00,880 --> 00:21:01,760
Your fork.

676
00:21:01,780 --> 00:21:03,100
If you don't want to starve,

677
00:21:03,130 --> 00:21:05,700
