678
00:21:06,380 --> 00:21:07,280
Come on!

679
00:21:07,300 --> 00:21:08,230
Ms. Danis,

680
00:21:08,250 --> 00:21:10,230
I'm forced to stay handcuffed to him,

681
00:21:10,250 --> 00:21:12,490
