682
00:21:12,510 --> 00:21:13,270
Yes.

683
00:21:14,310 --> 00:21:16,190
Just treat each other better.

684
00:21:16,210 --> 00:21:17,970
- Mm.
- And stop fighting already.

685
00:21:17,990 --> 00:21:18,990
Never!

686
00:21:19,750 --> 00:21:20,750
I can take care of myself.

687
00:21:21,300 --> 00:21:22,470
I don't need his help!

688
00:21:32,600 --> 00:21:34,730
That's what you get
for relying only on luck!

689
00:21:34,750 --> 00:21:36,230
Not your brain.

690
00:21:36,310 --> 00:21:37,990
You have to use a fork!

691
00:21:41,750 --> 00:21:42,320
Look.

692
00:21:44,940 --> 00:21:45,710
Dream on!

693
00:21:49,350 --> 00:21:50,000
There!

694
00:21:50,950 --> 00:21:52,460
Mr. Big Brain,

695
00:21:52,480 --> 00:21:54,860
how are you gonna use your fork now?

696
00:21:56,090 --> 00:21:56,730
What are you looking at?

697
00:21:57,100 --> 00:21:58,600
Want me to feed you? Hm?

698
00:22:01,370 --> 00:22:03,210
- Seriously,
- Hey!

699
00:22:03,230 --> 00:22:04,520
- when are these two
- I didn't get to eat...

700
00:22:04,540 --> 00:22:06,350
- so you don't get to either!
- gonna stop fighting?

701
00:22:06,370 --> 00:22:07,150
Auntie,

702
00:22:07,170 --> 00:22:08,990
it won't be long until
they drop the tough act.

703
00:22:09,010 --> 00:22:11,190
They'll give up soon enough.

704
00:22:11,700 --> 00:22:14,290
But they're being silly
and now fighting with utensils.

705
00:22:14,490 --> 00:22:15,490
That's true, Auntie.

706
00:22:16,190 --> 00:22:17,470
Did they watch too many movies?

707
00:22:17,490 --> 00:22:19,090
Ugh...

708
00:22:21,810 --> 00:22:22,770
Stop.

709
00:22:23,830 --> 00:22:26,520
[The D Dorm]

710
00:22:29,710 --> 00:22:30,650
Oh, wow!

711
00:22:31,290 --> 00:22:32,180
So refreshing!

712
00:22:32,890 --> 00:22:34,860
Very refreshing.

713
00:22:35,290 --> 00:22:36,150
Oh?

714
00:22:36,170 --> 00:22:36,980
What are you looking at?

715
00:22:37,010 --> 00:22:38,180
Are you thirsty?

716
00:22:38,600 --> 00:22:39,550
