721
00:22:45,540 --> 00:22:46,600
I'll have to say...

722
00:22:47,150 --> 00:22:49,470
♫Water, I need...♫

723
00:22:49,490 --> 00:22:50,360
Ugh!

724
00:22:50,980 --> 00:22:51,680
Why are you singing?

725
00:22:51,830 --> 00:22:53,230
The more you talk,
the more thirsty you'll get.

726
00:22:53,610 --> 00:22:54,510
Danis,

727
00:22:54,620 --> 00:22:56,490
starving us is a bit cruel, don't you think?

728
00:22:56,520 --> 00:22:57,980
When will you let us go?

729
00:22:58,300 --> 00:22:59,000
Oh!

730
00:22:59,430 --> 00:23:00,430
Then make up already.

731
00:23:00,590 --> 00:23:01,150
- Never!
- Never!

732
00:23:01,190 --> 00:23:01,890
Hey...

733
00:23:02,190 --> 00:23:03,370
Keep on starving, then.

734
00:23:04,350 --> 00:23:05,720
Danis, that's too cruel.

735
00:23:05,800 --> 00:23:07,150
Don't worry, boys.

736
00:23:07,170 --> 00:23:08,590
I'm not going to torture you.

737
00:23:08,610 --> 00:23:10,850
I bought you an ice cold coffee.

738
00:23:10,870 --> 00:23:12,000
Thank you, Auntie.

739
00:23:15,070 --> 00:23:15,710
Here.

740
00:23:17,080 --> 00:23:18,510
