741
00:23:18,530 --> 00:23:19,830
Where is the coffee?

742
00:23:19,970 --> 00:23:21,160
Here it is.

743
00:23:21,180 --> 00:23:23,200
Your coffee.

744
00:23:23,600 --> 00:23:24,690
Here.

745
00:23:26,870 --> 00:23:27,870
Whoa...

746
00:23:28,120 --> 00:23:29,520
You tied it like those
food in plastic bags.

747
00:23:29,680 --> 00:23:31,470
