748
00:23:31,620 --> 00:23:32,630
Help each other out, then.

749
00:23:33,120 --> 00:23:34,960
Lend each other a hand.

750
00:23:34,980 --> 00:23:36,270
The coffee you drink

751
00:23:36,290 --> 00:23:38,290
after facing obstacles and adversities

752
00:23:38,310 --> 00:23:41,040
will taste much sweeter,
aromatic, and delicious.

753
00:23:41,730 --> 00:23:42,510
Hey, give me that!

754
00:23:43,080 --> 00:23:44,290
No need to untie it.

755
00:23:44,310 --> 00:23:45,250
I'll bite the bottom and drink!

756
00:23:46,770 --> 00:23:47,420
Give me that!

757
00:23:51,290 --> 00:23:53,240
Things don't seem to go
as planned, Ms. Danis.

758
00:23:55,810 --> 00:23:56,810
I think...

759
00:23:57,010 --> 00:23:58,300
Should we leave them?

760
00:23:58,320 --> 00:24:00,910
From the looks of it,
they won't make up with each other.

761
00:24:00,930 --> 00:24:02,040
No, Auntie.

762
00:24:02,060 --> 00:24:03,720
We've come this far.

763
00:24:03,740 --> 00:24:04,840
We'll have to see it to the end.

764
00:24:05,390 --> 00:24:06,980
After drinking that much,

765
00:24:07,000 --> 00:24:08,390
